      "consequence": "In currentBranch, trim throws a TypeError, its catch swallows it, and it always returns null. The CLI in main.ts then always prints \"not a git repository\" and exits 1.",
      "fix": "Update currentBranch and changedFiles to read result.stdout in the same change. Another option is to keep a string-returning wrapper for existing callers."
